WEBVTT

00:03:59.151 --> 00:04:02.905
so the only possibilities
are these 8 options:

00:04:02.905 --> 00:04:07.451
the two-digit immune with additional
3s or 7s on their ends.

00:04:08.244 --> 00:04:11.789
3 can’t follow 3,
nor 7 follow 7.

00:04:11.789 --> 00:04:18.004
And once again, adding the digits 
reveals that 237 and 537

00:04:18.004 --> 00:04:19.714
are divisible by 3.

00:04:20.339 --> 00:04:26.846
737 is 67 times 11, 
so that leaves just 373,

00:04:26.846 --> 00:04:30.308
which is, in fact, prime,
and therefore immune.